  "body": "This PR contains the following updates:\n\n| Package | Type | Update | Change | References |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| rollup | devDependencies | minor | `1.2.3` -> `1.4.0` | [source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup) |\n\n---\n\n### Release Notes\n\n<details>\n<summary>rollup/rollup</summary>\n\n### [`v1.4.0`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;140)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.3.3...v1.4.0)\n\n_2019-03-01_\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Add option to change the name of the dynamic import function to allow polyfilling it ([#&#8203;2723](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2723))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2723](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2723): Add dynamicImportFunction option ([@&#8203;keithamus](https://togithub.com/keithamus))\n\n### [`v1.3.3`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;133)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.3.2...v1.3.3)\n\n_2019-03-01_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Fix performance regression when handling long chains of calls to property methods ([#&#8203;2732](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2732))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2730](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2730): Order types, interfaces, classes, and object members ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n-   [#&#8203;2732](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2732): Take chunk export mode into account when reexporting default ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.3.2`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;132)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.3.1...v1.3.2)\n\n_2019-02-27_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Allow ids of default exported classes to be exported separately ([#&#8203;2728](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2728))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2728](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2728): Update dependencies ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.3.1`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;131)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.3.0...v1.3.1)\n\n_2019-02-27_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Correctly reexport the default export from entry chunks ([#&#8203;2727](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2727))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2727](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2727): Take chunk export mode into account when reexporting default ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.3.0`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;130)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.2.5...v1.3.0)\n\n_2019-02-26_\n\n##### Features\n\n-   Treeshake call expressions prefixed with UglifyJS style `@__PURE__` annotations ([#&#8203;2429](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2429))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2429](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2429): Add support for /_#**PURE**_/ comments ([@&#8203;conartist6](https://togithub.com/conartist6) and [@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n### [`v1.2.5`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;125)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.2.4...v1.2.5)\n\n_2019-02-26_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Store external ids reported by plugins in watch mode ([#&#8203;2718](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2718))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2718](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2718): Incremental external ([@&#8203;andreas-karlsson](https://togithub.com/andreas-karlsson))\n\n### [`v1.2.4`](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md#&#8203;124)\n\n[Compare Source](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/compare/v1.2.3...v1.2.4)\n\n_2019-02-26_\n\n##### Bug Fixes\n\n-   Fix an issue where a variable was imported twice under the same name ([#&#8203;2715](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/issues/2715))\n\n##### Pull Requests\n\n-   [#&#8203;2715](https://togithub.com/rollup/rollup/pull/2715): Deduplicate imports referencing default exports and their original variables ([@&#8203;lukastaegert](https://togithub.com/lukastaegert))\n\n</details>\n\n---\n\n### Renovate configuration\n\n:date: **Schedule**: \"every weekend\" in timezone Europe/Paris.\n\n:vertical_traffic_light: **Automerge**: Enabled.\n\n:recycle: **Rebasing**: Whenever PR is stale, or if you modify the PR title to begin with \"`rebase!`\".\n\n:no_bell: **Ignore**: Close this PR and you won't be reminded about this update again.\n\n---\n\n - [ ] <!-- renovate-rebase -->If you want to rebase/retry this PR, check this box\n\n---\n\nThis PR has been generated by [Renovate Bot](https://togithub.com/marketplace/renovate). View repository job log [here](https://renovatebot.com/dashboard#algolia/instantsearch.js).",
